                        "entry_id": "2a8f8483-2165-3472-ab7f-ae9a5d4cb2de",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif à l'asphalte, qui en contient."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "064beee8-5ab3-4b4d-a157-4e56c7657521",
                                "sense_id": "8d6bda6e-2b80-3b22-9a15-bf9b759f78d9",
                                "text": "Il y a du sable asphaltique pour faire le bitume."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a40fa02e-825b-4ce2-aa28-3550f1e5e3d3",
                        "source_entry_id": "2a8f8483-2165-3472-ab7f-ae9a5d4cb2de",
                        "source_sense_id": "8d6bda6e-2b80-3b22-9a15-bf9b759f78d9",
                        "target_lang_word": "asphaltic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "asphaltic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ec5ced8-1b84-3a91-9459-4d11d620376e",
                                        "entry_id": "514c481f-642c-3a3c-a610-f9a993ac961a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resembling, containing, or relating to asphalt or bitumen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3401c31-6f17-49bb-9fdf-5e667440a620",
                                                "sense_id": "6ec5ced8-1b84-3a91-9459-4d11d620376e",
                                                "text": "asphaltic concrete; asphaltic sediment"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04f4874b-2375-45b3-a222-e350bf5e1866",
                                                "sense_id": "6ec5ced8-1b84-3a91-9459-4d11d620376e",
                                                "text": "The aggregated Soyle\nDeath with his Mace petrific, cold and dry,\nAs with a Trident smote, and fix’t as firm\nAs Delos floating once; the rest his look\nBound with Gorgonian rigor not to move,\nAnd with Asphaltic slime,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76a5da67-0ca2-49ac-8a4f-dc6acec1c22a",
                                                "sense_id": "6ec5ced8-1b84-3a91-9459-4d11d620376e",
                                                "text": "Hears the hoarse bittern, where Gomorrah stood;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edb991cf-c3fe-485c-9948-e57a32df00ad",
                                                "sense_id": "6ec5ced8-1b84-3a91-9459-4d11d620376e",
                                                "text": "[…] the congealed frost lay ten inches thick in a hard, asphaltic pavement,"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1b5edc2a-d2a3-3aec-9423-572034a8074e",
                                        "entry_id": "514c481f-642c-3a3c-a610-f9a993ac961a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to the Dead Sea (salt lake between Jordan and Israel)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fab84ca-af94-4e24-847a-8547498ff55f",
                                                "sense_id": "1b5edc2a-d2a3-3aec-9423-572034a8074e",
                                                "text": "As Sodomes Apples, neere th’Asphalticke lake,\nOf specious shew, yet touch’t, to ashes turning,\nSo are sinnes poysons sweete, yet bane to take;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90c442e5-90a3-47ee-9bb0-a2894e16e251",
                                                "sense_id": "1b5edc2a-d2a3-3aec-9423-572034a8074e",
                                                "text": "[…] who gather from the fragrant shrub\nThe aromatic balsam, and extract\nIts milky juice along the lovely side\nOf winding Jordan, till immers’d it sleep\nBeneath the pitchy surface, which obscures\nTh’ Asphaltic lake."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
